        "title": "Sonnet model updated to claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022",
        "summary": "The `sonnet` model constant now uses `claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022`, replacing `claude-3-5-sonnet-20240620`. The update follows the note to use the latest Sonnet model. It is limited to `common/src/constants.ts`, the shared/core model list; the `haiku` entry remains unchanged.",
