        "title": "Add please and apply to skipped terminal commands",
        "summary": "Added 'please' and 'apply' to the SKIPPED_TERMINAL_COMMANDS blacklist in common/src/constants.ts. This prevents Freebuff from attempting to execute these specific commands within the terminal interface. The change affects the shared core constants used by CLI and Web surfaces.",
        "significance": "minor",
        "at": "2026-09-15T18:34:49.886Z"
      },
      "eli5": {
        "text": "The assistant will now ignore the words 'please' and 'apply' when they're typed as commands, so it won't try to run them as actions. This affects both the command-line and web versions of the tool. If you typed 'please' or 'apply', nothing would happen instead of the tool attempting to process them.",
